        "description": "Space buns offer a playful and symmetrical way to manage curls, effectively splitting the volume of your hair into two manageable sections. By positioning the buns either high on the head or low near the ears, you can customize the style to fit your specific gear, such as sunglasses or hat brims.\n\nFor curly-haired women, space buns are excellent at preventing the \u201cmonobun\u201d weight that can cause headaches during long excursions. They keep the hair completely off the face and neck, making them ideal for humid summer hikes where sweat can quickly lead to matting.\n\nThis style is also very easy to refresh; simply re-coil the buns if they loosen during a particularly active stretch.",
