        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_290_16.jpg",
        "description": "If you have exceptionally long or thick curly hair, a single braid might feel too heavy or prone to loosening. The triple braided ponytail solves this by first securing a high ponytail and then splitting that hair into three separate braids.\n\nThese smaller braids are much less likely to \u201cfrizz out\u201d than one large one, and they create a unique, textured look. You can leave the three braids hanging separately, or braid them together into one \u201cmega-braid\u201d for maximum containment.\n\nThis multi-layered approach provides incredible security against high winds and ensures that your hair stays flat and out of the way of your gear.",
