          "Let the curls cool fully, brush them out into soft, uniform waves, and then very lightly mist a shine spray over the surface, keeping the can at a distance so it does not weigh down the hair. Focus the shine product on the mid-lengths and ends instead of the roots, which keeps the overall look glossy and glamorous while still maintaining volume at the crown."
