        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_294_10.jpg",
        "description": "Side part pigtail curls give a slightly more grown-up twist to the usual center-part look while still feeling cute and youthful. Create a deep side part at the front, then part the rest of the hair down the back so you still have two even sections overall.\n\nSecure each side into pigtails at the same height, but let the part line curve so more hair falls on one side near the face. This creates a soft, flattering frame around the features and can help balance different face shapes.\n\nEnhance the lengths with curl cream or mousse, then scrunch to create defined curls that bounce when she moves. A simple headband or a couple of small clips near the heavier side of the part can add a neat finish without taking away from the curls.",
