          "This haircut looks especially good on 2C to 3B curls because it gives natural texture a lived\u2011in, effortless vibe without needing many styling steps. Ask your stylist for short, choppy crown layers, longer back pieces, and soft, face\u2011framing pieces in the front rather than a blunt fringe.",
          "For styling, use a lightweight mousse or foam to keep curls bouncy, diffuse in different directions to avoid flat spots, and let some ends air dry so the overall shape stays soft and touchable."
