        "description": "A sleek curled under bob is perfect if you love a clean, glassy finish. The cut is usually one length with minimal layering and very sharp lines so the bob looks almost graphic when styled straight.\n\nThe ends are just barely tucked under to soften the silhouette and keep it from looking too harsh. Straighten your hair section by section with a flat iron, then use the iron to bend the last inch under, keeping the curve subtle rather than rounded.\n\nFinish with a shine spray or serum and a humidity resistant hairspray so your sleek bob stays smooth and reflective all day.",
