        "numberTitle": "4. Curly Refresh High Ponytail",
        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_301_12.jpg",
        "description": "A high curly ponytail refresh is a go-to when you want a quick, lifted style that still shows off your texture. Start by misting your hair lightly all over, then apply a small amount of gel or styling cream along the hairline and crown.\n\nBrush or smooth your curls upward into a high ponytail, keeping tension even but not too tight to protect your curls and edges. Secure with a soft elastic, then scrunch the ponytail with damp hands or a bit of mousse to revive any flat sections.\n\nIf you like more polish, wrap a small section of hair around the base of the ponytail to hide the elastic and pin it in place. This refreshed look works for the gym, busy workdays, or nights out, giving you movement, height, and defined curls in minutes.",
