        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_301_4.jpg",
        "description": "A high puff refresh is ideal for coily or very curly textures when your roots feel fuzzy but your ends are still springy. Lightly mist the entire head until curls feel pliable, then smooth a curl cream or gel around the perimeter to tame frizz and define texture.\n\nBrush the sides and back upward using a soft brush, gathering curls at the crown without pulling too tight. Use a stretchy band or scarf to secure the puff, pushing it up gradually so the curls sit on top with lots of volume.\n\nFluff the puff with your fingers, separating a few curls for extra fullness and shape. This refresh keeps your curls off your neck, protects your ends, and gives you a bold, lifted look that works for casual days, the gym, or a quick office-ready hairstyle.",
