        "numberTitle": "11. Curly Space Buns Refresh Look",
        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_301_7.jpg",
        "description": "Space buns make a playful refresh option when your roots are puffy and the ends of your curls need a quick perk-up. Part your hair down the middle, then section it into two halves from front to back.\n\nLightly mist each side with water or refresh spray, scrunching to revive curl shape before styling. Gather one side into a high or mid-height ponytail, twist it loosely, then wrap into a bun and secure with an elastic or pins, repeating on the other side. Leave a few curls loose at the front for softness, and smooth edges with a bit of gel if you like a more polished finish. This refreshed look is fun for weekends, festivals, or casual days, and it keeps your curls protected while still showing off their natural texture and bounce.",
