        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_301_14.jpg",
        "description": "A wet look refresh works when your curls feel dry and dull but you want an evening-ready, glossy finish. Start by misting your hair more generously than usual so it feels quite damp, not just lightly spritzed.\n\nApply a shine-focused gel or jelly from roots to ends in sections, smoothing with your fingers or a wide-tooth comb for sleek definition. Avoid over-scrunching; instead, press curls upward gently so they keep a clumped, defined shape that mimics freshly hydrated curls.\n\nLet your hair air-dry without touching it, or use a diffuser on low speed to set the cast. Once fully dry, you can leave the gel cast for a strong wet effect or lightly scrunch it out for softer, glassy curls that still look polished and intentional.",
