        "description": "A refreshed low bun works well when your lengths feel dry and frizzy but you still want a neat, put-together look. Begin by misting your hair from mid-lengths down, adding a lightweight leave-in conditioner to boost moisture and slip.\n\nSmooth your hair back with your hands or a soft brush into a low ponytail at the nape, keeping tension gentle to avoid breakage. Twist the ponytail loosely and wrap it into a bun, securing it with a scrunchie or bobby pins.\n\nTo keep the texture visible, don\u2019t over-slick the surface; let some natural curl pattern show through while taming flyaways with a small amount of gel. This refreshed bun is ideal for workdays, workouts, or whenever you want your curls contained while still caring for their health and moisture.",
