        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_301_18.jpg",
        "description": "Curly bangs often lose shape quickly, so a focused bang refresh can transform your whole hairstyle even if the rest of your curls are fine. Lightly clip back the rest of your hair, then mist only your bangs until they\u2019re evenly damp.\n\nApply a small amount of curl cream or gel, combing it through with your fingers to evenly coat each strand. Use finger coiling or gentle scrunching to encourage uniform curl clumps and bounce.\n\nLet the curls air-dry without touching them, or diffuse on low while holding them in place if needed for direction. Once dry, fluff at the roots with your fingertips to avoid separation lines, and your refreshed bangs will instantly make your whole curly look feel sharper and more intentional.",
