        "description": "Long natural hair paired with flexi rods creates a jaw-dropping result. The spirals cascade down the shoulders with incredible movement and shine.\n\nThe key on longer hair is to work in very neat, thin sections so the curl wraps evenly from root to end without gaps or uneven spots. Using a medium to large flexi rod gives you loose romantic spirals rather than tight coils, which suits longer lengths well.\n\nApply generous amounts of styling product to each section before rolling to ensure the curl holds throughout the length of the hair. Once dry and unraveled, the curls are long, bouncy, and full of life, making this one of the most stunning natural hair looks possible.",
