        "numberTitle": "8. Overnight Flexi Rod Set on Natural Hair",
        "image": "assets/curly_hairstyles_302_11.jpg",
        "description": "The overnight flexi rod set is perfect for naturals who want to set their hair before bed and wake up to beautifully dried curls in the morning. Apply your styling products as usual, section the hair, and wrap each rod carefully.\n\nSleep with a satin bonnet or on a satin pillowcase to protect the rods and reduce frizz while you sleep. By morning, the hair is fully dry and the curls are perfectly set. This hands-off approach is ideal for busy people who do not have time to sit and wait for hair to dry during the day. The curls are especially well-formed after a full night of drying and tend to last longer when allowed to dry slowly this way.",
