        "description": "Is your main goal to just soften your facial features and look more approachable? Soft curly layers are the answer to your hair prayers.\n\nUnlike the choppy shag, this haircut focuses on smooth, seamless layers that blend invisibly into one another. There are no harsh lines or abrupt changes in length. The curls just melt into each other, creating a cascading waterfall effect. This cut is universally flattering and removes just enough weight to let your curls breathe. It works wonderfully on medium to long lengths. It gives off a gentle, kind, and elegant energy. You only need a wide-tooth comb to detangle it gently from the ends up.",
