        "image": "assets/curly_over50_273_11.jpg",
        "description": "Who says you have to cut your hair short when you hit sixty? A long curly haircut can look absolutely breathtaking on older women if it is properly maintained.\n\nThe key is adding extremely long layers to prevent the hair from looking flat or triangular. This cut keeps the length below the shoulders while keeping the hair light and movable. Long curly hair can be worn down for elegant events or swept into a loose, romantic updo for everyday wear. It provides a soft, romantic, and bohemian vibe that defies age expectations. You will need to invest in deep conditioning treatments to keep the long curls healthy and hydrated.",
