        "description": "Do you want a haircut that commands attention the second you walk into a room? A voluminous curly short haircut is all about maximizing the natural body of your hair.\n\nThis cut keeps the hair relatively short all over but leaves enough length to allow the curls to expand fully. Your stylist will cut the hair specifically to encourage upward and outward movement. This prevents the hair from collapsing flat against your skull. It creates a gorgeous, cloud-like halo of curls around your head.\n\nThis look is incredibly joyful and youthful. You just need to scrunch it gently with a microfiber towel after washing to encourage the maximum amount of bounce.",
