        "description": "What if your haircut actually encouraged you to do less? A wash and go curly haircut is specifically designed for women who want zero fuss in their morning routine.\n\nYour stylist will carve out the curl pattern using a technique called curly cutting or deva cutting. This method cuts each curl individually where it naturally wants to fall. The result is a perfectly formed curl pattern that requires no brushing or blow-drying. You literally wash it, apply a styling gel, and let it air dry. It eliminates frizz and maximizes definition. This cut works best on tightly coiled hair and gives you back hours of your week.!",
