          "Keeping your curls right at the shoulders prevents them from weighing down and stretching out. This length gives you plenty of room to play with fun accessories like headbands or claw clips. It also allows you to pull your hair back into a quick, loose updo when needed. Your stylist will add long layers to keep the bottom from looking bulky.",
          "This length is highly versatile and very elegant for older women. It moves beautifully when you walk and catches the light perfectly."
