        "numberTitle": "1. Wavy Cheekbone Bob",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_250_3.jpg",
        "description": "Soft waves at cheekbone length create a relaxed, effortlessly chic vibe that works for almost any occasion. This style takes the precision of a cheekbone bob and softens it with natural-looking bends and curves that add volume and dimension throughout.\n\nThe waves begin close to the roots and flow outward, giving the hair a lived-in, beachy quality that feels very current. It\u2019s especially flattering because the wave pattern creates width at the cheekbone area, making your facial structure look balanced and defined. If your hair is naturally wavy, this cut is practically maintenance-free. For straight hair, a one-inch curling wand wrapped loosely delivers that effortless texture. Finish with a flexible hold spray to keep the waves soft and touchable all day.",
