        "description": "Curtain bangs paired with a cheekbone-length bob create one of the most universally flattering hair combinations trending right now. The bangs part softly down the center and sweep outward, framing the face like a curtain \u2014 hence the name.\n\nWhen paired with a bob ending at the cheekbones, the bangs add a face-opening softness that balances the strong, structured length beautifully. This combination works for oval, round, heart, and even square faces because the soft fringe reduces the sharpness of the overall cut.\n\nIt\u2019s also a low-maintenance bang option since they blend into the sides of the hair as they grow. Use a round brush and a blow dryer to sweep the bangs outward and give them that signature effortless sweep.",
