        "description": "The shaggy cheekbone bob is part structured bob, part effortless shag \u2014 and the combination is absolutely magnetic. This cut features heavy layering throughout with soft, wispy ends that create a slightly messy, undone silhouette.\n\nThink curtain bangs, choppy face-framing layers, and diffused edges that make the hair look lived-in and intentionally tousled. At cheekbone length, the shaggy layers frame the face in a way that feels very cool and editorial. It\u2019s the perfect cut if you want low-effort styling with high-impact results. Fine to medium hair really thrives with this style because all those layers create volume and texture that wouldn\u2019t naturally exist.\n\nUse a sea salt spray on damp hair, scrunch lightly, and let it air dry for that effortlessly undone finish the shaggy bob is known for.",
