        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_250_1.jpg",
        "description": "A sharp, clean cut at cheekbone length is one of the most powerful looks in modern hair right now. The blunt cheekbone bob keeps all the hair at a single, even length with no layers \u2014 and that strong, geometric weight line is exactly what makes it so striking.\n\nThe edges catch the light and create a defined frame around the face. This cut works especially well on straight or slightly wavy hair because the smooth surface shows off the precise cut beautifully.\n\nIt also gives the illusion of thicker, fuller hair, which is a bonus for anyone with fine strands. Ask your stylist for a zero-degree blunt cut, and finish with a smoothing serum for a polished, glass-hair effect.",
