        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_250_9.jpg",
        "description": "Nothing quite signals \u201cpolished and in control\u201d like a perfectly sleek, pin-straight cheekbone bob. This style is all about smooth, glossy strands that fall in a single, clean line at cheekbone level.\n\nThere\u2019s no texture, no wave \u2014 just glass-smooth hair with a sharp perimeter that frames the face with precision. It\u2019s minimalist in the best possible way, and it has a very high-fashion, editorial quality that looks stunning in person and even better in photos. Women with naturally straight or slightly wavy hair get the most out of this look with minimal effort. A flat iron and a heat-protectant serum are your two best tools here.\n\nFinish with a glossing spray to boost the mirror-shine effect and keep those cheekbone-grazing ends looking razor-sharp.",
