        "numberTitle": "11. Modern French Bob With Texture",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_256_7.jpg",
        "description": "Tempted by the chic Parisian aesthetic but still want bounce? The modern French bob with texture is slightly longer than the traditional ear-length version, often hitting right at the chin.\n\nThis extra length allows room for adding light, airy texture to the ends. By softening the bottom perimeter, the hair gains the ability to curl outward or tuck inward playfully, rather than sitting flat against your jawline. Adding subtle layers or point-cutting the ends gives this timeless cut a much-needed contemporary upgrade. It retains its sophisticated European charm but gains a relaxed, movable quality that fits seamlessly into a busy lifestyle. Just add some sea salt spray to damp hair and let it air dry for perfect movement., Stylish Look",
