    "thumbnail": "assets/bob_haircuts_257_2.jpg",
    "introText": "The bob haircut remains one of the most iconic, versatile, and enduring hair trends of all time. Framing the face with flattering proportions and touchable volume, bob haircuts offer endless customization for every hair texture and lifestyle.\n\nFrom sleek asymmetrical angles to textured French crops and layered lobs, an expertly crafted bob enhances cheekbones while reducing daily styling time.\n\nBelow, explore 18+ inspiring bob haircut ideas to find your next signature look.",
