        "numberTitle": "11. Platinum Blonde Bob Haircut",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_263_1.jpg",
        "description": "There is something undeniably bold about a platinum blonde bob. This icy, near-white shade grabs attention instantly and gives off a high-fashion energy that works beautifully with a sharp, blunt cut.\n\nThe key to pulling off platinum is making sure your hair is in healthy condition before lightening, since the process involves significant bleaching. A blunt chin-length bob in platinum creates a striking contrast that flatters most face shapes, especially when paired with a deep side part.\n\nMaintenance is on the higher side with this shade, requiring regular toning treatments and purple shampoo to keep brassiness at bay. If you want a look that says confidence and modern edge, the platinum blonde bob is tough to beat.",
