        "numberTitle": "13. Burgundy Bob Haircut",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_263_9.jpg",
        "description": "Burgundy is a deep, wine-toned red that adds a sense of mystery and richness to a bob haircut. This bold shade combines red and purple undertones for a color that feels luxurious and slightly moody in the best possible way.\n\nIt looks especially striking on a blunt or angled bob where the clean lines of the cut let the color take center stage. Burgundy flatters a wide range of skin tones but is particularly gorgeous on deeper and olive complexions where the cool undertones in the color create a beautiful contrast.\n\nLike other red shades, burgundy does require some upkeep to prevent fading, but color-depositing shampoos and conditioners can extend the life of the color significantly between appointments. For a bob that feels bold, elegant, and completely unique, burgundy is a standout option.",
