        "numberTitle": "14. Ash Blonde Bob Haircut",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_263_4.jpg",
        "description": "Cool-toned ash blonde is the go-to choice for anyone who wants a blonde look without the warmth or brassiness. This muted, silvery shade gives a bob haircut a refined and sophisticated feel that leans slightly Scandinavian in its aesthetic.\n\nAsh blonde looks stunning on a sleek, straight bob where the color can show off its smooth, even tone from root to tip. It is especially flattering on cool or neutral undertones and can help neutralize any unwanted redness in the skin.\n\nKeeping this shade fresh does require regular toning visits and a good purple shampoo routine at home. The payoff is a clean, modern color that feels fresh year-round and pairs well with almost any style of bob, from blunt to layered.",
