          "It is often seen at major awards shows because it exudes timeless beauty and luxury. To achieve this, hair is set in rollers or curled in the same direction to create a continuous wave pattern. The side part is crucial here as it provides the foundation for the dramatic swoop over the forehead. High-shine sprays are used to give the hair a glass-like finish that catches the light perfectly.",
          "This hairstyle is the ultimate choice for anyone wanting a truly regal and vintage-inspired red carpet appearance."
