        "numberTitle": "14. Messy Side Part Bob",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_264_10.jpg",
        "description": "If you want to look cool and approachable, the messy side part bob is the way to go. This style is intentionally undone, featuring loose strands and a soft, blurred parting.\n\nIt mimics the \u201cjust woke up like this\u201d look but with a high-end fashion twist. The side part adds a bit of structure so the hair doesn\u2019t look completely unstyled. Using a dry shampoo or a light pomade can help achieve that perfectly tousled texture. It is a great choice for outdoor events or more casual red carpet appearances.\n\nThis hairstyle feels very current and relatable, making it a popular choice for younger stars. It emphasizes personality over strict tradition.",
