        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_264_3.jpg",
        "description": "The asymmetrical bob side part offers a bold and artistic take on the traditional short cut. One side of the hair is intentionally left longer than the other, creating a striking visual contrast.\n\nThis look is amplified by a deep side part that highlights the varying lengths. It is a fantastic option for those who want to stand out and express their unique style. The shorter side can be tucked behind the ear for a clean and sleek appearance. Meanwhile, the longer side provides a beautiful sweep of hair that frames the jawline. This cut is highly versatile and can be worn pin-straight or with light texture. It remains a favorite for fashion-forward celebrities.",
