        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_264_5.jpg",
        "description": "The voluminous side part bob is all about height, body, and maximum impact. This style is perfect for individuals who love a thick and full-haired look.\n\nUsing a round brush during the blowout process is the key to achieving this impressive lift at the roots. The side part serves as a pivot point, allowing the hair to stack and create a lush canopy. It works exceptionally well for medium to thick hair types that can support the added weight. You might also use a root-lifting mousse to ensure the volume stays consistent throughout the night.\n\nThis hairstyle creates a youthful and energetic vibe that feels both fresh and classic. It is a reliable showstopper.",
