        "description": "The chin length side part bob is a universally flattering cut that never goes out of style. As the name suggests, the hair ends precisely at the level of the chin.\n\nThis creates a neat frame for the lower half of the face and highlights the neck. Adding a side part gives the cut a more dynamic and less boxy feel. It allows for one side to be slightly more voluminous than the other, which balances out facial symmetry. This length is incredibly easy to style, whether you prefer it sleek or with a slight bend. It is often the preferred choice for a minimalist and sophisticated red carpet look that feels incredibly chic.",
