        "numberTitle": "17. Soft Layered Lob For Work",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_267_16.jpg",
        "description": "A soft layered lob is perfect when you want the ease of a bob with a little extra length for versatility. Falling around the collarbone, the cut features light layers around the face and subtle shaping through the ends, which keeps it from looking heavy.\n\nThis length works well with blouses, knitwear, and blazers because it sits nicely over shoulders without flipping unpredictably. It is especially flattering on thicker hair, where soft layers can remove bulk and create gentle movement without losing a professional outline.\n\nIn an office setting, you can wear it smooth with a center part, softly waved for a relaxed vibe, or pinned half-up on days when you need your hair completely away from your face.",
