        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_269_15.jpg",
        "description": "A wavy gray bob offers a soft and romantic aesthetic that is perfect for everyday wear and special occasions alike. This style uses gentle, beachy waves to add volume and dimension to silver hair, making it look thick, healthy, and full of life.\n\nIf your hair is naturally straight, you can easily achieve this look with a large-barrel curling iron or by braiding your hair overnight. The waves help to blend the different shades of gray and white, creating a multi-tonal effect that is very pleasing to the eye. This haircut is long enough to be versatile but short enough to be manageable during your transition away from chemical dyes. It is a timeless and feminine choice that never goes out of style for silver-haired beauties.",
