        "numberTitle": "16. Layered silver bob",
        "image": "assets/bob_haircuts_269_7.jpg",
        "description": "Sometimes a solid block of color can feel heavy, which is why incorporating multiple layers into your silver bob is so effective. The layered silver bob breaks up the hair\u2019s surface, allowing light to penetrate through the different levels and reveal the hidden dimension of your natural gray.\n\nThis cut is highly versatile and can be tailored to suit any face shape by adjusting where the layers begin and end. For those with fine hair, shorter layers on top can add much-needed lift and body. If your hair is thick, longer layers can help to remove excess bulk and make the transition feel more manageable. It is a soft, approachable style that pairs well with both casual weekend attire and formal evening wear.",
