    "introText": "For busy college students and trendsetters, the blunt bob haircut offers the perfect combination of effortless styling and crisp, modern aesthetics. Its clean perimeter line keeps hair looking full with minimal morning effort.\n\nAir-drying with a light texturizing cream or quick flat-ironing provides versatile options that transition easily from campus lectures to evening outings.\n\nBelow, explore 13+ effortless college-friendly blunt bob haircut ideas to copy.",
