        "image": "assets/blunt_bob_249_4.jpg",
        "description": "The short blunt French bob with bangs is that chic, slightly shorter cut that usually hits around the corners of the mouth and pairs with a fringe grazing the brows.\n\nThe blunt ends give it that modern structure that is trending, while the French influence shows up in the relaxed finish and soft internal texture that keeps the hair from looking too stiff. This bob flatters oval and heart-shaped faces especially well because it highlights the cheekbones and adds a gentle curve around the jaw.\n\nTo get the look, ask for a one length bob with subtle interior texturizing and a classic fringe that can be worn straight or slightly tousled. At home, rough-dry your hair, then use a flat iron only on the ends and bangs so it still has that effortless, slightly undone French feel without losing the sharp bob outline.",
