        "image": "assets/blunt_bob_249_7.jpg",
        "description": "A short blunt bob with micro bangs is bold, fashion-forward, and perfect if you like a cut that really stands out. The bob usually sits around the jaw or slightly above, creating a strong frame for the face, while micro bangs sit well above the eyebrows, exposing more forehead and emphasizing your eyes and brows.\n\nThis combination works especially well on oval and heart-shaped faces, which can handle a bit more forehead exposure without throwing off balance. Ask your stylist for a solid, blunt line on both the bob and the bangs, with minimal texturizing so the shape stays graphic and sharp. For styling, keep things sleek with a styling cream and flat iron, and maybe add a shine spray; the cleaner the finish, the more intentional and high-fashion the cut looks.",
