    "introText": "Honey warm blonde hair color brings rich golden depth and luminous warmth to every hairstyle. This sweet amber hue illuminates facial features with healthy, glossy shine.\n\nCombining soft root melting with golden honey ribbons creates a low-maintenance color gradient that stays vibrant for weeks.\n\nBelow, explore 16+ stunning honey warm blonde hair color ideas to inspire your next salon visit.",
