        "description": "Dimensional caramel blonde layers combine a layered haircut with varied tones of caramel, honey, and slightly deeper lowlights to create serious movement. The layers remove weight and help the color look more dynamic, especially on medium to long hair.\n\nStrategically placed lighter pieces on the surface and around the face brighten, while slightly deeper tones inside the hair keep it looking thick. This is a great choice if your hair tends to fall flat because both the cut and color add lift.\n\nAsk for a layered cut with face-framing pieces and blended caramel highlights, then style with a round brush or loose waves to showcase the dimension. Use color-safe, volumizing products so fullness does not come at the expense of moisture.",
