        "numberTitle": "1. Pixie Wedge Haircut For Women",
        "image": "assets/trending_haircuts_215_12.jpg",
        "description": "A pixie wedge haircut for women is a great pick if you want something very short but still softly feminine and full of shape. Think of it as a pixie with a slightly fuller, more rounded back and longer top layers that echo a classic wedge silhouette.\n\nThe nape is usually tapered or even slightly undercut for a clean finish, while the crown layers are cut to create lift and gentle volume. The sides can be left long enough to cover the tops of the ears or cropped shorter for a sharper look. This hybrid cut works well for straight or wavy hair, especially if you like very quick styling routines. A bit of styling cream or paste rubbed through the top is often enough to create texture and direction.\n\nThe pixie wedge also suits many face shapes because the extra height at the crown helps balance round or square features.",
