        "numberTitle": "2. Low Loc Ponytail",
        "image": "assets/ponytail_hairstyles_204_2.jpg",
        "description": "When you need a more relaxed and professional vibe, the low loc ponytail offers a sophisticated alternative that minimizes scalp tension. This style sits right at the nape of your neck, allowing the length of your locs to flow gracefully down your shoulders and back.\n\nIt is a fantastic option for those with heavy or mature locs who want to avoid the pulling associated with higher placements. You can keep it simple for everyday wear or dress it up by adding metallic cuffs or colorful threads throughout the gathered hair.\n\nThis look is incredibly easy to maintain and works perfectly under hats or headscarves during the cooler seasons without losing its neat, organized structure.",
