        "numberTitle": "4. Half Up Half Down Loc Ponytail",
        "image": "assets/ponytail_hairstyles_204_4.jpg",
        "description": "Can you decide between wearing your hair up or letting it flow? The half up half down loc ponytail gives you the best of both worlds by securing only the top section of your hair.\n\nThis style creates height and volume at the crown while allowing the remaining locs at the back to hang freely around your shoulders. It is a highly popular choice in 2026 because it offers a romantic and soft aesthetic that suits all face shapes.\n\nYou can customize this by making the top ponytail small and neat or voluminous and messy. It is also a great way to manage thickness if pulling all your hair up feels too heavy.",
