        "description": "Sisterlocks are known for their tiny size and immense versatility, and the sisterlocks ponytail takes full advantage of this lightweight texture. Because each loc is so thin, the ponytail looks much more like a traditional loose hair ponytail but with the added benefit of loc structure.\n\nYou can create very intricate, sleek styles that are difficult to achieve with thicker traditional locs. This look is often worn high and sleek for a high-fashion appearance or mid-height for a professional daily routine. The flexibility of sisterlocks allows you to braid the base or create complex knots that stay secure and comfortable all day. It is an elegant and refined way to showcase your intricate loc journey.!",
