        "numberTitle": "18. Side Loc Ponytail",
        "image": "assets/ponytail_hairstyles_204_3.jpg",
        "description": "The side loc ponytail is an excellent way to add a playful and asymmetrical touch to your look without much effort. By shifting the base of your ponytail to one side, you create a soft frame for your face that feels feminine and fresh.\n\nThis variation is particularly popular for social gatherings or casual outings where you want a bit more personality than a standard centered style. To keep the look secure, you may need to use a few hair pins to tuck away shorter locs at the back. It works beautifully with medium to long lengths, providing a lovely drape that showcases the unique texture and color of your individual locs as they rest.",
