        "numberTitle": "1. Messy Textured Ponytail",
        "image": "assets/ponytail_hairstyles_210_16.jpg",
        "description": "A messy textured ponytail proves that imperfection can still look professional. The key is to make the messiness look intentional rather than careless.\n\nStart by applying a texturizing spray or sea salt spray to your hair for grip and grit. Pull your hair back into a low ponytail, leaving some fullness at the crown and a few loose pieces around your face. Gently tug at sections of the ponytail to create natural-looking volume and dimension. The result should be soft, touchable, and full of movement.\n\nThis style is ideal for creative offices or more relaxed business casual environments where personality and personal style are encouraged. It works on all hair types but is especially flattering on wavy or layered hair.",
