        "image": "assets/ponytail_hairstyles_210_11.jpg",
        "description": "Women with naturally curly hair often feel that ponytails are not an option for the office, but that is far from the truth. A curly ponytail can look incredibly polished and chic when styled intentionally.\n\nThe trick is to define your curls first using a leave-in conditioner or curl cream, then gather your hair into a low or mid-height ponytail. Avoid pulling the hair too tightly, as this can cause frizz and disrupt your curl pattern. Let your curls spring naturally from the elastic for a beautiful, voluminous look. This style celebrates your natural texture while keeping your hair out of your face. It works for all curl types, from loose waves to tight coils, and looks stunning with business casual outfits.",
