        "numberTitle": "11. Half-Up Half-Down Ponytail",
        "image": "assets/ponytail_hairstyles_210_12.jpg",
        "description": "A half-up half-down ponytail gives you the best of both worlds. The top half stays secured and neat, while the bottom half flows freely, adding movement and softness to your overall look.\n\nThis is a great option for women who find full ponytails too severe or uncomfortable but still want a polished appearance for the office. Section the top half of your hair, from your temples to the crown, and pull it back into a small ponytail at the back of your head.\n\nYou can keep the lower section straight, wavy, or curly depending on your preference. This style works well with layered haircuts because the layers add natural shape and dimension to the loose bottom section.",
