        "image": "assets/ponytail_hairstyles_211_14.jpg",
        "description": "A ponytail with a hair scarf feels very vacation-ready and adds instant color and personality to your resort dinner look. Start with a mid or low ponytail, either sleek or softly textured depending on your outfit.\n\nTie a lightweight silk or satin scarf around the base of the ponytail in a single knot or small bow, letting the ends drape down with your hair. Choose prints or colors that complement your dress rather than clash with it. You can wrap the scarf around the base several times for a more secure hold. Keep the rest of your hair simple so the scarf stands out, and avoid very heavy fabrics that might feel too warm in tropical climates.\n\nThis look is ideal for medium and long hair and immediately makes even a basic ponytail feel vacation-worthy.",
