        "description": "If you love volume and drama, a high curly ponytail brings movement and glamour to a resort evening. Start with curls\u2014either natural curls enhanced with curl cream or heat-styled ringlets.\n\nBrush only the roots back toward a high ponytail at the crown or slightly above, keeping the lengths as curly as possible. Secure it tightly and smooth the hairline with gel or edge control if needed. You can pick out the curls with your fingers to make the ponytail fuller without causing frizz. A wrapped base or decorative hair cuff can instantly elevate the look.\n\nThis style looks great with halter and off-the-shoulder dresses and works very well with curly, coily, or wavy hair. If your curls are shorter, clip-in curly ponytails offer a quick way to achieve this resort dinner look.",
