        "description": "If you like simple, feminine looks, a ponytail with loose waves is a versatile option for almost any resort dinner plan. Curl your hair in large sections, wrapping away from the face to open up your features.\n\nOnce cooled, brush through gently for soft, loose waves. Gather hair into a mid or low ponytail, allowing the waves to fall together and create a full, flowing shape. Leave a few pieces out near the temples for a relaxed feel. Secure with an elastic, then wrap a strand around the base to hide it if you want a more finished look.\n\nFinish with a light texture spray so the waves keep their shape through the evening without feeling stiff. This style works for most hair types and lengths that reach at least past the shoulders, making it a reliable go-to on vacation.",
