        "description": "A sleek ponytail with a wrapped base is one of the easiest ways to make your hair look salon-level for a resort dinner. Straighten your hair smoothly, making sure the roots lie flat without ridges.\n\nPull it back into either a mid or low ponytail, depending on what works best with your neckline. Take a one-inch section from the underside of the ponytail, wrap it tightly around the elastic several times, and secure the end with a bobby pin tucked underneath. This small detail instantly makes your ponytail look dressier and more intentional. Finish the lengths with a straightener or large curls, based on your outfit. A bit of anti-frizz serum will add shine and protection against humidity. This style is great for all hair types and is ideal if you want something minimal but polished at the resort.",
