        "description": "A deep side part low ponytail gives instant elegance for resort dinners, especially when you want a softer, more romantic frame around your face. Create a deep side part on the more flattering side of your face, then smooth hair toward a low pony at the nape or slightly off to one side.\n\nUse a fine-tooth comb and a bit of smoothing cream along the part line to keep it clean and frizz-free. Wrap a small section of hair around the elastic to finish the base neatly. You can keep the lengths straight and glossy or add loose S-waves for movement. Tuck the lower side behind your ear and pair with statement earrings for a sophisticated resort dinner look.\n\nThis ponytail flatters almost every face shape and works for medium to long hair with or without layers.",
