    "thumbnail": "assets/pastel_hair_color_196_13.jpg",
    "introText": "Hidden pastel peekaboo hair color is the ultimate secret weapon for adding a burst of fun tone without full-head bleaching. Placed beneath natural top layers, it reveals itself with motion.\n\nWhether you opt for pastel pink ribbons, icy blue contrasts, or soft violet streaks, peekaboo color looks effortlessly chic when styled in half-up updos or loose waves.\n\nBelow, discover 18+ playful hidden pastel hair color ideas to inspire your next salon color refresh.",
