        "image": "assets/modern_haircuts_181_16.jpg",
        "description": "Prefer a shade with a sultry, misty vibe? The smoky silver butterfly haircut delivers a hazy, muted metallic tone that looks effortlessly cool and slightly undone.\n\nThis color is achieved by leaving a hint of warmth or applying a sheer gray toner over lightened hair, resulting in a smudged, smoky finish. On the butterfly cut, this hazy shade makes the layers look incredibly soft and touchable rather than sharp and stark.\n\nThe shorter layers blend into the longer ones with a misty transition, removing any harsh lines from the cut. It is a highly stylish, low-maintenance look that captures a moody, avant-garde aesthetic while keeping the hair looking effortlessly textured and chic.",
