        "image": "assets/modern_haircuts_181_9.jpg",
        "description": "Searching for a way to blend warm and cool tones? The rose gold silver butterfly haircut merges soft pink metallic hues with frosty ash for a uniquely feminine finish.\n\nRose gold adds just enough warmth to keep the silver from feeling too harsh, making it exceptionally flattering for various skin tones. When applied to the butterfly cut, the rosy tones are usually concentrated on the shorter, face-framing layers to brighten the complexion.\n\nThe longer back sections fade into a true metallic ash, creating a gorgeous color story that flows throughout the style. It is a romantic, trendy twist that brings out the soft, fluttery nature of this heavily layered haircut beautifully.",
