        "description": "How about adding a hint of mystical charm to your layers? The violet silver butterfly haircut infuses a subtle purple tint into the metallic base, creating a multi-dimensional, iridescent effect.\n\nViolet and silver naturally complement each other, as the purple acts as a toning agent to keep the hair icy while adding a beautiful reflective sheen. On a butterfly cut, the shorter top layers catch the light differently than the longer underneath layers, revealing hidden purple tones as you move.\n\nThis color pairing makes the textured wings of the haircut look vibrant and full of life. It is a playful yet sophisticated choice for anyone wanting to stand out from the traditional metallic crowd.",
