        "image": "assets/modern_haircuts_181_18.jpg",
        "description": "Looking to neutralize brassy undertones completely? The cool toned silver butterfly haircut focuses entirely on eliminating warmth to produce a crisp, clean, and icy finish.\n\nThis relies on strong blue and violet pigments in the toner to counteract any yellow hues left behind after bleaching. The result is a pure, true metallic that looks incredibly sharp. When applied to a butterfly cut, the complete absence of warmth allows the actual structural carving of the haircut to be the star. The crisp color enhances the textured, feathered ends of the layers, making them look precise and freshly cut.\n\nIt is a refreshing, clean approach that makes the whole hairstyle look incredibly sharp and polished.",
