        "description": "Looking for ultra-fine, natural-looking dimension? The silver babylights butterfly haircut uses incredibly delicate, micro-fine highlights to mimic the naturally sun-kissed hair you had as a child.\n\nBabylights require tiny sections of hair to be foiled, resulting in a seamless, heavily blended metallic finish that looks completely natural. On a butterfly cut, this fine highlighting technique ensures that every single layer has a touch of brightness running through it.\n\nThe short voluminous layers and the long underneath layers both receive equal attention, preventing the color from looking blocky. It is a perfect, subtle approach for those who want the texture of the cut to shine through with refined, delicate pops of cool metallic tone.",
