        "numberTitle": "18. Silver Ombr\u00e9 Butterfly Haircut",
        "image": "assets/modern_haircuts_181_7.jpg",
        "description": "Want a seamless gradient from dark to light? The silver ombr\u00e9 butterfly haircut provides a striking color transition that enhances the layered structure perfectly.\n\nUnlike a balayage, which is painted on for a softer blend, an ombr\u00e9 features a more distinct line where the darker roots meet the lightened ends. This stark transition happens right where the shortest butterfly layers begin, making the cut\u2019s built-in volume highly visible. The bright metallic ends catch the light, creating the illusion of thicker, heavier hair at the bottom, which balances the volume at the top. It is a gorgeous, dramatic way to wear the cut that adds serious depth and visual interest to your flowing lengths.",
