        "numberTitle": "5. Butterfly Haircut With Center Part",
        "image": "assets/modern_haircuts_183_11.jpg",
        "description": "A symmetrical parting beautifully highlights the natural architecture of this style. The butterfly haircut with center part allows the top layers to fall equally on both sides of the face, perfectly mimicking the wings of a butterfly in flight.\n\nThis balanced look is incredibly chic and gives off a cool, retro vibe that remains highly trendy. The center part naturally draws the eye downward, subtly elongating a rounder face shape while showcasing the cheekbones. During the summer, this parting is practical because it keeps the hair out of your eyes and distributes the volume evenly. It looks fantastic worn straight, or you can add a large barrel curling iron for a polished, bouncy finish.",
