        "image": "assets/modern_haircuts_183_14.jpg",
        "description": "Dreaming of romantic, mermaid-like hair? The butterfly haircut with soft waves is the quintessential summer style.\n\nUsing a large curling iron or overnight braids, adding gentle waves to this cut completely transforms the look. The curls bring out the contrasting lengths, allowing the shorter top layers to bounce up while the longer layers cascade down in a fluid motion. This styling method maximizes the wing-like effect, giving the hair incredible movement and an undeniable romantic flair. Soft waves also help to blend any harsh lines between the different layers, resulting in a seamless, cohesive finish.\n\nIt is an elegant choice for summer weddings, garden parties, or any time you want to feel effortlessly beautiful.",
