        "description": "Sometimes all you need is a little contouring around the front to completely change your vibe. The butterfly haircut with face framing layers takes the core concept of the style and pushes it forward.\n\nThe front sections are meticulously graduated, starting from the cheekbones and getting longer as they reach the collarbone. This technique perfectly highlights your jawline and eyes, creating a slimming effect that looks fantastic in summer photos.\n\nThe shorter front pieces seamlessly melt into the rest of the hair, ensuring the cut looks cohesive rather than choppy. Whether you decide to wear your hair in a sleek straight style or with beachy waves, these framing pieces will do all the heavy lifting to keep you looking radiant.",
