        "description": "If you have an oval face shape, you have the most versatile options available. The butterfly haircut for oval face can be customized in almost any way because the proportions of the face naturally suit layered styles.\n\nYou can opt for shorter, bouncier top layers that hit at the cheekbone to highlight your eyes, or longer, sweeping layers for a more dramatic effect. The natural balance of an oval face allows the wing-like structure of the cut to truly shine without throwing off your facial symmetry.\n\nAdding a center part or curtain bangs looks particularly striking. It is a foolproof way to wear this trend, guaranteeing a stunning, flattering result that looks effortlessly chic.",
