        "numberTitle": "1. Butterfly Haircut For Round Face",
        "image": "assets/modern_haircuts_187_15.jpg",
        "description": "Choosing the right layers can dramatically flatter your facial structure. The butterfly haircut for round face shapes works wonders by adding much-needed height at the crown and elongating the overall silhouette.\n\nThe shorter top layers create vertical volume, which visually stretches the face and makes it appear more oval. Meanwhile, the longer face-framing layers hit right at the cheekbone or jawline, creating sharp angles where there are none. This draws the eye up and down rather than side to side, effectively balancing out the roundness. Keeping the part slightly off-center and pairing the cut with sweeping curtain bangs enhances the slimming effect, resulting in a beautifully proportioned and strikingly flattering hairstyle.",
