    "thumbnail": "assets/layered_hairstyles_164_11.jpg",
    "introText": "Layered hairstyles remain unmatched for their ability to bring immediate volume, touchable texture, and fluid motion to hair of any length or density.\n\nFrom face-framing curtain bangs and soft ghost layers to classic shags and airy texturizing, adapting the depth and angle of your layers allows you to highlight your best facial features.\n\nBelow, explore 17+ inspiring layered hairstyle ideas to save for your next salon appointment.",
