        "description": "Why settle for a basic cut when you can have something striking? The asymmetrical bob haircut features one side longer than the other, creating a dramatic, diagonal line.\n\nThis uneven weight distribution is a clever trick to lift the hair off the face. The heavier, longer side sweeps beautifully, while the lighter side stays tucked back, creating natural swing and dimension. The sudden shift in length stops the eye from seeing a flat, uniform shape. Instead, you get a dynamic, architectural look that turns heads.\n\nIt is a chic, high-fashion choice that adds instant body and a wildly flattering, beautiful angle.",
