        "image": "assets/layered_hairstyles_167_18.jpg",
        "description": "Get the best of both worlds with this hybrid style. The textured pixie bob combines the lift of a pixie with the swing of a bob.\n\nThe back is kept short and layered, while the front features longer, face-framing pieces. Heavy texturizing throughout the crown removes bulk, allowing the shorter layers to push the longer pieces up. This creates a beautiful, tousled shape that looks full and dynamic. The soft ends prevent the cut from looking blocky or severe.\n\nIt is a fantastic, versatile choice for someone wanting a shorter style with beautiful, natural movement and absolutely zero flat spots.",
