        "image": "assets/layered_hairstyles_167_16.jpg",
        "description": "Channel effortless Parisian chic with a cut that oozes charm. The French bob with texture hits right at the chin or cheekbone, immediately removing heavy lengths that drag hair down.\n\nWhat sets this apart is the heavy point-cutting at the ends. This technique creates a soft, slightly jagged edge instead of a blunt, heavy line. The result is a lightweight, airy shape that naturally expands outward for a full, fluffy look. Paired with a slightly messy, undone finish, this style looks incredibly voluminous and fresh.\n\nIt is a sophisticated, timeless choice that completely eliminates the flat, lifeless hair problem almost instantly.",
