    "introText": "Voluminous, 90s-inspired supermodel layers and bouncy blowouts are the ultimate expression of healthy, glamourous hair with maximum movement.\n\nMastering tension with a round ceramic brush or thermal rollers lifts roots and sets sweeping curtain ends that stay lively all day long.\n\nBelow, discover 17+ celebrity-inspired blowout and supermodel layer ideas to elevate your daily hairstyle.",
