        "description": "Curtain bangs layered blowout is the ultimate trend for 2026, offering a chic way to frame the forehead and blend into longer side layers. This style is characterized by \u201cswooping\u201d bangs that part down the middle, resembling a pair of curtains.\n\nWhen styling, it is crucial to blow the bangs back and away from the face using a small round brush to create that effortless, winged-out look. The rest of the layered hair should be dried with a slight bend at the ends to complement the movement of the fringe.\n\nThis combination is a favorite among celebrities because it is low-maintenance yet provides a high-impact, fashion-forward appearance that suits almost every face shape.",
