          "Ask your stylist for minimal, face\u2011framing pieces that start around the cheekbones or chin, since this draws attention upward and makes your hairline look denser. This kind of long layered cut works especially well if your hair is straight or softly wavy, because the layers are subtle and won\u2019t create thin, feathery strands.",
