        "image": "assets/layered_fine_hair_148_18.jpg",
        "description": "The sleek polished butterfly layered cut proves that you don\u2019t need a messy texture to have volume. This version uses high-shine serums and precise blow-drying to create a \u201cglass hair\u201d finish on the butterfly layers.\n\nFor fine hair, the shine helps to reflect light, which makes the hair look more substantial and \u201cexpensive.\u201d The layers are kept very clean and defined, with each \u201cwing\u201d perfectly smooth and directed. It is a modern, high-fashion take on the butterfly trend that is perfect for formal events or for someone who prefers a more \u201cput-together\u201d and structured aesthetic in their daily life.",
