        "description": "The layered pixie cut is the ultimate power move for anyone struggling with fine or thinning hair. By keeping the hair short and incorporating many different layer heights, you create a look that is bursting with personality and volume.\n\nThe layers can be styled forward to frame the face or pushed back for a more daring and edgy appearance. Because the hair is so short, the layers provide a structure that is impossible to achieve with longer lengths.\n\nThis cut also draws attention to your eyes and cheekbones, making it a very flattering choice for mature women. It is a bold statement that proves you do not need long hair to have a lot of style.",
