        "numberTitle": "5. Feathered bob fine hair",
        "image": "assets/layered_fine_hair_155_2.jpg",
        "description": "The classic bob receives a major upgrade when you introduce feathered ends into the mix for a softer finish. A feathered bob is particularly effective for fine hair because it creates the illusion of thickness right at the jawline where hair often looks thinnest.\n\nInstead of a blunt edge that can feel heavy and flat, the feathered approach adds airiness and a playful bounce to every step you take. This style is incredibly versatile, working well for both professional settings and casual weekend outings without requiring much effort.\n\nJust a small amount of volumizing mousse applied to damp hair before air-drying can give you that sought-after \u201cundone\u201d texture that is trending right now.",
