        "image": "assets/doc_cool_balayage_2.jpg",
        "description": "Ombre and bronde already make a great team, but adding auburn into the mix creates something truly eye-catching. Copper bronde ombre keeps your roots in a rich brown or dark auburn shade and gradually transitions into warm blonde ends with soft copper ribbons woven throughout the mid-lengths.\n\nThe contrast between the darker crown and lighter tips gives hair a gorgeous sense of movement and fullness. This look flatters oval, heart, and round face shapes equally well because the lighter ends draw attention downward and elongate the overall silhouette.\n\nPair it with loose waves or beachy texture to really let every single shade shine through in natural light.",
