        "numberTitle": "9. Auburn Bronde Curly Hair Color",
        "image": "assets/doc_cool_balayage_16.jpg",
        "description": "Curly hair and auburn bronde color are a match made in heaven because natural curl patterns already create incredible dimension, and multi-tonal color amplifies that effect tenfold. Auburn bronde on curly hair means every individual curl can showcase a different blend of brown, blonde, and copper, creating a vibrant, three-dimensional look that straight-haired people can only dream of.\n\nThe key is using a hand-painted technique like balayage rather than foils so the color follows the natural curl pattern and looks organic. This combination is particularly striking on types 3 and 4 curls where the coils really let each shade stand out on its own.",
