        "description": "Babylights are ultra-fine, delicate highlights that mimic the natural hair color children often have, and when applied in auburn bronde tones the result is breathtakingly subtle. Light auburn bronde babylights use tiny streaks of copper gold and pale blonde over a light brown base, creating a barely-there dimension that looks completely natural.\n\nThis is the perfect option for someone who wants their color enhanced rather than transformed. Because the highlights are so fine, the grow-out phase is nearly invisible, making this one of the most low-maintenance color choices available.\n\nIt flatters almost every complexion and hair type, giving a soft, ethereal quality to the overall look.",
