        "numberTitle": "8. Mocha Color Melt",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_19_11.jpg",
        "description": "The mocha color melt is a beautifully balanced brunette option that blends cool and warm brown tones together in one seamless look. Think of it as coffee-colored hair with genuine depth \u2014 the roots start at a deep, rich mocha brown and soften into lighter, milky coffee tones through the mid-lengths and ends.\n\nIt is a versatile look that suits virtually every skin tone and hair texture, and it photographs beautifully in both natural and artificial light. What makes this melt especially popular is how naturally it grows out \u2014 since all the shades are in the same color family, there is no awkward line of demarcation as the hair grows.\n\nIt is a top pick for brunettes who want a subtle refresh without anything drastic. Pair with a high-shine gloss treatment for maximum impact.",
