        "description": "If you are looking for maximum drama and depth, chestnut brown hair with black lowlights is a striking choice. The warmth of the chestnut provides a beautiful glow, while the stark black lowlights create intense shadows.\n\nThis combination is very popular for winter as it feels moody and bold. The black lowlights should be applied sparingly to avoid a \u201cstripey\u201d look; instead, they should be woven into the under-layers for a peek-a-boo effect.\n\nThis adds a sense of mystery and weight to the hair, making it look incredibly thick. It is a powerful look that suits individuals with strong features and a confident personal style who love deep colors.",
        "paragraphs": [
          "If you are looking for maximum drama and depth, chestnut brown hair with black lowlights is a striking choice. The warmth of the chestnut provides a beautiful glow, while the stark black lowlights create intense shadows.",
          "This combination is very popular for winter as it feels moody and bold. The black lowlights should be applied sparingly to avoid a \u201cstripey\u201d look; instead, they should be woven into the under-layers for a peek-a-boo effect.",
          "This adds a sense of mystery and weight to the hair, making it look incredibly thick. It is a powerful look that suits individuals with strong features and a confident personal style who love deep colors."
        ],
