        "image": "assets/doc_b_25_9.jpg",
        "description": "Opting for layered platinum hair with dirty blonde lowlights is a classic choice for a \u201clived-in\u201d and effortless look. Dirty blonde provides a realistic, slightly darker base that makes the platinum layers pop with intense brightness.\n\nThe layers help to distribute the lowlights evenly, ensuring that the dimension is visible from every angle. This style is perfect for busy individuals who want a high-impact hair color that is relatively easy to maintain.\n\nThe natural-looking lowlights allow for a more graceful regrowth at the roots, meaning you can wait a bit longer between touch-ups. It is a flattering and functional style that provides plenty of volume and texture for a modern, active lifestyle.",
