        "description": "If you are looking for a creative twist, icy blonde hair with lavender lowlights offers a playful yet sophisticated pop of color. The lavender tones are kept very light and pastel so they function like traditional lowlights, providing depth without being overwhelming.\n\nThis combination is incredibly trendy for 2026, as it leans into the \u201cfairycore\u201d aesthetic while remaining grounded in professional hair coloring techniques. The cool purple hues naturally counteract yellow tones, helping the platinum stay bright and crisp for longer.\n\nThis style is best suited for those who enjoy experimenting with their look and want something unique. It looks particularly stunning in braids or intricate updos where the purple strands can peek through.",
