    "introText": "Hand-painted balayage remains the premier choice for achieving soft, natural-looking hair illumination. Sweeping lighter tones through mid-lengths and ends creates organic movement and depth.\n\nBecause balayage grows out seamlessly without harsh demarcation lines, it offers a luxurious, low-maintenance color solution for any hair length.\n\nBelow, browse 15+ versatile balayage hair color ideas to save for your next salon visit.",
