        "image": "assets/doc_b_30_2.jpg",
        "description": "For those seeking a modern and low-maintenance approach to color, silver pearl balayage for older women is the gold standard in contemporary styling. This hand-painted technique allows the colorist to strategically place pearlescent tones where they will most benefit the face, such as around the cheekbones and eyes.\n\nBecause the highlights are concentrated toward the mid-lengths and ends, there is no harsh line of demarcation as your natural hair grows in at the roots. This creates a soft, lived-in appearance that exudes effortless sophistication.\n\nThe blend of charcoal, silver, and pearl tones provides a \u201clit-from-within\u201d effect that helps the hair look thicker and more vibrant, which is a common concern for maturing hair textures.",
