        "image": "assets/doc_b_30_3.jpg",
        "description": "Adding a bold touch to a classic look is easily achieved with pearl gray money piece highlights, a trend that remains incredibly popular for its face-brightening capabilities. This style involves applying concentrated, bright pearlescent highlights to the strands immediately framing the face, while keeping the rest of the hair a more muted silver or natural salt-and-pepper.\n\nBy bringing the lightest, most reflective tones closest to the skin, you create an instant lifting effect that draws attention to your features. This is an excellent option for mature women who want to experiment with high-contrast color without committing to a full head of highlights.\n\nIt provides a crisp, clean finish that looks exceptionally polished when paired with a sharp bob or a textured pixie cut.",
