    "introText": "If you love sun-kissed brightness with seamless root transitions, blonde balayage offers the ultimate low-maintenance glow. Hand-painted highlights melt gracefully into natural roots for a soft, lived-in finish.\n\nPairing custom beige or platinum tones with a root shadow ensures soft regrowth lines, keeping your color looking salon-fresh for months between touch-ups.\n\nBelow, browse 15+ handpicked blonde balayage inspiration photos to spark your next hair transformation.",
