        "numberTitle": "3. Platinum Balayage on Short Hair",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_38_7.jpg",
        "description": "Short hair and platinum blonde balayage is a bold, confident look that\u2019s gaining serious traction in 2025 and 2026. Pixie cuts, short bobs, and cropped styles all take on a totally different energy when you add icy platinum balayage tones.\n\nThe technique focuses color through the top and crown sections while keeping the nape and sides slightly deeper, which adds structure and shape. This approach actually makes short styles look more intentional and editorial rather than simple.\n\nThe contrast between the deeper root and bright platinum tips gives the haircut more visual interest and definition. For women who love a cropped style and want their hair color to do the talking, this platinum balayage approach is one of the most effective ways to elevate a short cut.",
