        "numberTitle": "1. Cool Beige Blonde Highlights On Dark Brown Hair",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_40_5.jpg",
        "description": "On dark brown hair, cool beige blonde highlights create a chic, smoky contrast that feels modern but still wearable day to day. The highlight pieces are lifted high enough to cancel underlying red or orange, then toned with an ashy beige that sits between silver and creamy blonde.\n\nStrategically placed around the face and through the top layer, they brighten without turning your overall color too light. This look is ideal if your skin has cool or neutral undertones, since the cooler beige will harmonize instead of fighting with your complexion.\n\nAt home, use a purple shampoo once a week to keep brassiness in check and always follow with a hydrating conditioner, as darker hair usually needs more moisture after lightening.",
