    "introText": "Brighten your style with multi-tonal blonde highlights. From creamy champagne tones to bold money pieces, adding lighter ribbons creates instant texture and depth.\n\nUsing a combination of fine baby-lights and dimensional lowlights prevents blonde hair from looking flat, giving your hair healthy shine and visual movement.\n\nBelow, save 14+ favorite blonde highlight ideas to share with your colorist.",
