        "numberTitle": "1. Dark Espresso Brunette Hair Color",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_48_1.jpg",
        "description": "Few shades feel as instantly polished as a true dark espresso brunette. This color sits right between deep brown and soft black, giving you that rich, near-inky depth without the starkness of a full black dye.\n\nThe real magic here is the glossy, reflective finish \u2014 it makes hair look healthy and dimensional even as a single-process color. Espresso brunette works exceptionally well on olive, warm, and medium skin tones, and it\u2019s just as flattering on deep complexions.\n\nThe key to nailing this look is finishing with a gloss treatment or a shine serum that amplifies the depth without making it look flat. It\u2019s bold, classic, and endlessly wearable across seasons.",
