        "numberTitle": "19. Espresso Brunette with Caramel Ribbons",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_48_5.jpg",
        "description": "There is something irresistibly warm and inviting about deep espresso hair punctuated with soft caramel ribbons. The contrast between the near-black base and the warm golden-brown highlights creates a stunning visual depth that feels dimensional without being high-maintenance.\n\nColorists typically apply the caramel tones through the face frame and mid-lengths to maximize the lightening effect around the complexion. The trick is keeping the ribbons subtle \u2014 just a shade or two lighter than the base so they add warmth without looking like a full highlight job.\n\nThis look suits almost every skin tone and pairs beautifully with both sleek blowouts and natural waves. It\u2019s a perfect style for someone transitioning from a lighter brunette to a darker, richer shade.",
