        "numberTitle": "21. Mocha Espresso Hair Color",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_48_3.jpg",
        "description": "Mocha espresso is the kind of rich, layered brunette that genuinely turns heads. Think of it as the middle ground between a dark chocolate and a true espresso \u2014 it has that warm, multi-tonal quality that catches light differently depending on the angle.\n\nWarm caramel and mocha undertones weave through the dark base, creating subtle dimension without straying too far from deep brunette territory. It\u2019s a great pick if you love rich brown shades but want something that feels a little more dynamic than a flat single-process color.\n\nThis shade works beautifully on long, straight, or wavy hair, where the tonal variation can really show off its depth and movement from root to tip.",
