        "numberTitle": "22. Dark Roast Brunette Glossy Bob",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_48_1.jpg",
        "description": "A dark roast brunette color on a glossy bob is one of the most polished, sophisticated hair looks you can wear right now. The structured, sleek shape of a bob haircut amplifies the depth and shine of deep brown shades, making every strand look intentional and refined.\n\nWhether you opt for a blunt bob, a layered bob, or an inverted bob, the dark roast brunette palette \u2014 from espresso to chocolate to molten brown \u2014 reads incredibly luxurious at chin or shoulder length. The shorter cut means the color is fully visible from all angles, making the high-shine finish of a gloss treatment worth every penny.\n\nThis combination works beautifully for professional settings and everyday wear alike. Add a face-framing highlight or two for that extra bit of brightness if your complexion needs some light reflection.",
