        "description": "Curly ruby red hair is a beautiful way to celebrate natural texture while embracing a high-impact color. Red tones look amazing on coils and curls because the natural twists of the hair catch the light at different angles, revealing the hidden dimensions of the ruby dye.\n\nBecause curly hair tends to be naturally drier, it is vital to prioritize moisture when going red to ensure the color remains vibrant and the curls stay defined. Using sulfate-free cleansers and regular steam treatments will help lock in the pigment while maintaining the hair\u2019s elasticity.\n\nWhether you have tight 4C coils or loose beachy curls, ruby red adds a layer of personality and confidence to your crown.",
