        "description": "Nordic white blonde mid length waves draw inspiration from the natural, bright blondes often seen in Scandinavian countries. This color is clear and bright, mimicking the look of hair that has been naturally lightened by a cold, northern sun.\n\nMid-length hair provides enough surface area to show off the beautiful waves without being overwhelming. This style is incredibly versatile and suits almost every face shape.\n\nIt feels fresh and clean, making it a great choice for any season. Using a sea salt spray can help enhance the waves, giving the white blonde a beachy, effortless texture that feels modern and very easy to wear.",
