    "thumbnail": "assets/doc_b_56_9.jpg",
    "introText": "Unlocking rich, multidimensional brown hair color is all about pairing warm chocolate or cool espresso tones with glossy lowlights and face-framing accents.\n\nLived-in brunette shades remain a salon staple because they enhance natural shine while requiring minimal touch-up visits.\n\nBelow, check out 15+ inspiring brunette hair color ideas to give your locks a fresh, healthy upgrade.",
