          "The effect is very natural, almost like the way children\u2019s hair lightens in the sun, which makes it ideal if you want your dark brunette to look softly illuminated rather than obviously colored. This trend has been gaining attention because it offers a fresh alternative to heavy balayage, especially for people who like their hair mostly dark. It works best on hair with some movement\u2014soft waves, layered blowouts, or natural curls\u2014because each \u201cfleck\u201d catches the light differently. Grow-out is easy, since the accents are small and not anchored right at the root, so this can be a great choice if you want to stretch salon visits.",
