          "When you move, those lighter strands catch light through the mid-lengths and ends, almost like a chocolate glaze wrapping the hair. This look is also great if you have a one-tone box-dye history and want to upgrade to something more dimensional without going \u201clight.\u201d It grows out softly, so you can usually stretch appointments a bit longer as long as you protect the richness with sulfate-free shampoo and regular glosses."
