        "numberTitle": "1. Chestnut brown balayage hair",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_60_5.jpg",
        "description": "Chestnut brown balayage hair offers a modern and lived-in approach to color that requires very little upkeep. This hand-painted technique involves blending various shades of chestnut from the mid-lengths to the ends, leaving the roots a natural, darker brown.\n\nThe result is a soft, graduated effect that looks like your hair has been naturally lightened by the sun. This style is incredibly versatile because it works on all hair lengths and textures.\n\nBecause the roots remain natural, you can go months between salon visits without worrying about harsh regrowth lines. It is a sophisticated way to add dimension and a touch of luxury to your everyday hairstyle.",
