        "numberTitle": "20. Silver Money Piece On Brunette Hair",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_64_5.jpg",
        "description": "If you want to brighten your entire face without coloring your whole head, a silver money piece on brunette hair is the most effective solution. This trend involves lightening the two front sections of hair that frame the face and toning them to a bright, reflective silver.\n\nThe high contrast against the rest of your brown hair draws immediate attention to your eyes and cheekbones, acting like a built-in highlighter. It is a bold, Gen-Z inspired look that has gained massive popularity for its versatility and ease of upkeep.\n\nYou can keep the rest of your hair a solid chocolate brown or add a few scattered silver ribbons to tie the entire look together beautifully.",
