        "image": "assets/doc_b_65_17.jpg",
        "description": "For a bolder take on soft ombre, light brown to platinum is a striking choice that pulls off high contrast while still keeping the blending smooth and natural. Starting with a lighter brown base actually makes the transition to platinum more achievable and less damaging than jumping from very dark hair.\n\nThe platinum tips deliver a cool, fashion-forward brightness that feels very current for 2025 and 2026 trends. The key to making this ombre look refined rather than overly dramatic is expert blending at the mid-shaft \u2014 skilled colorists use a balayage hand-painting technique to soften the boundary between shades.\n\nPlatinum ends require dedicated moisture care, including deep conditioning masks and heat protectant products used consistently to maintain softness and prevent breakage.",
