        "numberTitle": "1. Beige Brown Babylights",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_68_15.jpg",
        "description": "Beige brown babylights are all about neutrality and balance. This highlight color is neither too warm nor too cool, making it a \u201cfail-safe\u201d option for any mature brunette.\n\nThe \u201cbeige\u201d element softens the brown, creating a sandy, creamy effect that looks incredibly natural. Because they are applied as babylights (very fine sections), the color integrates perfectly with the base.\n\nThis is the ideal choice for someone who wants to \u201cwake up\u201d their hair color without a noticeable change. It provides a subtle shimmer that makes the hair look like it\u2019s in its best possible condition, reflecting light in a soft, flattering way that enhances the skin\u2019s natural texture.",
