        "numberTitle": "2. Caramel Highlights With Gray Blending",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_69_2.jpg",
        "description": "Caramel highlights bring warmth and richness to brunette hair while doing double duty as a gray blending tool. The golden-amber tones sit beautifully next to both brown and silver strands, creating a cohesive look that feels natural and glowing.\n\nThis option is ideal for brunettes who prefer to keep some warmth in their hair rather than going fully cool-toned. Caramel highlights work well on all shades of brown, from light chestnut to deep espresso, and they add a sun-kissed quality that brightens your overall complexion.\n\nYour stylist can place them throughout your hair or concentrate them around the face for a framing effect. As your grays grow in, the caramel tones catch the light and help disguise the transition line at the roots, giving you weeks of gorgeous, low-maintenance color between appointments.",
