        "image": "assets/doc_b_69_13.jpg",
        "description": "Cream bronde sits perfectly between blonde and brunette, offering a soft, creamy tone that bridges the gap between brown and silver beautifully. This highlight shade is particularly effective for gray blending because it is light enough to camouflage silver strands but warm enough to stay connected to your brown base.\n\nThe result is a smooth, buttery color that looks expensive and effortless at the same time. Cream bronde highlights work well on light to medium brown hair and can be applied using balayage or traditional foil techniques depending on the intensity you want.\n\nThe tonal quality of cream bronde is neutral enough to flatter most skin tones, and it grows out without any harsh lines. For brunettes who want to soften their gray transition without going full blonde, cream bronde highlights strike that perfect balance every time.",
