        "image": "assets/doc_b_69_17.jpg",
        "description": "Rose-tinted highlights introduce a soft, blush-pink tone into your brunette base, offering a unique and flattering approach to gray blending. The pale rose shades draw the eye with their subtle warmth, which helps distract from the contrast between your brown hair and incoming silver strands.\n\nThis technique is particularly beautiful on women with fair or cool skin tones, as the pink undertones enhance the natural flush in your complexion. Your stylist can keep the rose tones very sheer and muted for a barely-there effect or build them up for a more visible, playful result.\n\nThe rose highlights also complement your gray strands beautifully, creating a soft, romantic color story that feels fresh and modern. As your grays grow in, they blend into the rosy blonde tones, keeping the overall look cohesive and charming between appointments.",
