        "image": "assets/doc_b_69_16.jpg",
        "description": "Salt and pepper highlights take direct inspiration from the natural mix of dark and light strands that happens as hair grays, and they elevate it into a deliberate, refined look. For brunettes, this technique involves adding strategic lighter pieces, often in silver, pewter, or ash blonde tones, throughout your natural brown base to create that classic peppered effect.\n\nThe result is a sophisticated, low-maintenance color that makes your gray transition look elegant and purposeful. This approach works at every stage of graying, whether you have just a few silver strands or a significant amount of gray throughout your hair.\n\nYour stylist can adjust the ratio of light to dark to match your natural graying pattern and your personal preference. Salt and pepper highlights grow out seamlessly because the color change is already blended and tonal, making this one of the easiest gray blending options to maintain long-term.",
