        "image": "assets/doc_b_69_8.jpg",
        "description": "For brunettes ready to make a bolder statement while blending their gray hair, platinum highlights deliver striking contrast and undeniable edge. These icy, near-white highlights stand out against a dark brown base and create a dramatic, high-contrast look that turns silver strands into a deliberate design element.\n\nThis approach is best suited for women who are comfortable with a more noticeable color change and want their gray blending to feel fashion-forward rather than subtle. Your stylist will use a strong lightener to lift selected sections to a pale, silvery blonde, then tone them to remove any unwanted warmth.\n\nThe placement can be concentrated at the front for a face-framing effect or scattered throughout for a more diffused look. Platinum highlights pair beautifully with your natural grays, making the entire color feel cohesive and intentional.",
