        "image": "assets/doc_b_69_19.jpg",
        "description": "Espresso highlights with ash tones are a darker, more understated approach to gray blending that keeps your hair firmly rooted in the brunette family. This technique uses deep, rich brown tones laced with cool ash undertones to create a multi-dimensional color that absorbs gray strands rather than highlighting them.\n\nThe ash component is the secret here, as it provides just enough coolness to harmonize with silver strands while maintaining the depth and richness of dark brunette hair. Your stylist will weave these toned sections throughout your hair, focusing on areas where grays are most concentrated.\n\nThe result is a glossy, sophisticated brunette that looks like you simply have incredibly rich, varied natural hair color. This option is perfect for women who prefer to stay dark but want to address their grays in a way that looks seamless and completely natural.",
