        "image": "assets/doc_b_69_20.jpg",
        "description": "An icy blonde melt is a smooth, seamless gradient that transitions your brunette roots into icy, silvery blonde ends, making it an exceptional choice for gray blending. The melt technique eliminates any harsh lines between your natural brown and the lightened sections, creating a fluid transition that makes your gray strands look like part of the overall color journey.\n\nThe icy tone at the ends mirrors the look of fully silver hair, so as your grays grow in from the roots, they simply extend the color story that is already happening at the bottom of your hair. Your stylist will carefully blend the lightener from dark to light, then tone the ends with a cool, silvery formula.\n\nThe result is a striking, high-impact look that works beautifully for brunettes who are ready to embrace their gray transition in a bold, fashion-forward way.",
