        "image": "assets/doc_b_73_17.jpg",
        "description": "Warm bronde ribbon highlights are the definition of effortless cool. Bronde sits right between brown and blonde, and when applied as ribbon sections, it creates a seamlessly dimensional look that\u2019s neither too light nor too dark.\n\nThe warmth in this version comes from golden and amber undertones, making it incredibly flattering for fall and spring styling. Warm bronde ribbons feel natural \u2014 like your hair just naturally lightened in the sun \u2014 but the ribbon technique gives it the defined, modern structure that makes it look intentional.\n\nThis is one of the most requested ribbon highlight looks because it suits virtually every brunette shade and skin tone. It\u2019s also one of the easier looks to maintain, since the warm bronde tone grows out gracefully without stark regrowth lines.",
