        "image": "assets/doc_b_73_15.jpg",
        "description": "Hazelnut hits a perfect warm-cool balance that not many other highlight shades can claim. As a ribbon highlight color on brunette hair, hazelnut creates a trifecta of depth: a rich dark base, warm hazelnut ribbons, and the optional addition of a few lighter blonde pops for extra dimension.\n\nThe result feels layered and complex without looking overdone. Hazelnut ribbon highlights are ideal for brunettes who want to stay in the brown family while still creating obvious dimension and movement.\n\nThis color reads as natural and sophisticated, making it well-suited for professional settings or those who prefer a classic, polished hair aesthetic. Wavy or curly hair textures make hazelnut ribbons stand out especially well, since the movement of the hair plays up the contrast.",
