        "description": "Want to add a cool-toned pop to warm brunette hair? Thin platinum and beige ribbon highlights are the answer.\n\nThese lighter, cooler ribbons cut through a dark brunette base and create a striking contrast that works for both warm and cool skin tones. The trick is in the balance \u2014 too much platinum can feel icy, but when mixed with softer beige ribbons, the look becomes a well-rounded, interesting color story. Colorists often combine these two tones through the same ribbon sections for a more dimensional finish. On straight hair, the effect is graphic and sharp.\n\nOn wavy or textured hair, the cooler ribbons add an unexpected freshness that makes the whole look feel modern and editorial.",
