          "This technique works on straight, wavy, and curly hair because the color placement follows the natural movement of the strands. For a natural result, the highlight shade is usually only two to three levels lighter and is tuned to your undertone\u2014warmer tones like caramel or golden beige for warmer skin, cooler beige or mushroom tones for cooler complexions.",
