        "description": "Long wavy brunette hair and warm caramel balayage are a naturally gorgeous pair. When your hair has length and movement, those hand-painted caramel ribbons have more room to flow and create that waterfall effect people love.\n\nYour stylist will usually focus the brightest caramel toward the mid-lengths and ends, adding extra pieces around the face so everything feels seamless when styled. Loose, polished waves or beachy curls show off every shade and make the color look more dimensional.\n\nThis look is great if you want a high-impact change that still grows out softly because the root area remains mostly brunette. Regular hydrating masks and a sulfate-free, color-safe shampoo will help maintain shine, especially on longer hair that can dry out more easily.",
