        "image": "assets/doc_b_78_16.jpg",
        "description": "Looking for a style that is fun and functional? Butterfly layers half up half down gives you the best of both worlds.\n\nBy pinning back the top layers, you highlight the incredible volume at your crown. The rest of your hair flows down, showing off the long, bouncy layers. This is a favorite for college girls heading to campus events or spring formals. It looks intricate but is incredibly easy to achieve.\n\nSimply clip the top section back, leaving the shorter face-framing pieces out to soften the look. You get the elegance of an updo with the playful movement of wearing your hair completely down and looking absolutely stunning all day long.",
