    "introText": "Achieving that salon-fresh, high-volume bounce at home is all about mastering tension, direction, and thermal protection. From retro 90s bombshell flips to silky modern curtain sweeps, a professional-level blowout elevates any hair texture.\n\nTop session stylists recommend working in neat horizontal sections with a round ceramic brush, letting each warm curl cool completely before unspooling to lock in maximum shape and movement.\n\nBelow, discover 16+ celebrity-inspired blowout looks to help you master the ultimate glamorous, head-turning finish.",
