        "image": "assets/doc_b_79_7.jpg",
        "description": "Sabrina Carpenter\u2019s signature layered cut with curtain bangs has become one of the most requested looks because it works with so many blowout styles.\n\nThis blowout focuses on making the curtain bangs and front layers swoop out and blend smoothly into the rest of the hair, creating a halo of movement around the face. The lengths are usually softly blown out with lots of airy volume rather than stiff curls, keeping that flirty, youthful feel.\n\nStylists often use a round brush or small roller just for the bang area, directing the hair away from the face, then finish with a flexible spray so the fringe stays open instead of splitting. The look pairs well with romantic dresses, structured blazers, or casual outfits and instantly makes any basic blowout feel more on-trend and celebrity-inspired.",
