        "image": "assets/doc_b_79_20.jpg",
        "description": "Many wedding guest hairstyles now borrow directly from celebrity red carpet blowouts, especially the soft, romantic versions. A red carpet soft blowout for wedding guests usually combines gentle volume, brushed-out bends, and a glossy finish that looks great from ceremony to reception.\n\nThe goal is hair that feels elevated but not over-styled, so it works with dresses, jumpsuits, or suits and still photographs beautifully in both candid and posed shots. Stylists often prep with long-wear products like heat protectant, light mousse, and flexible hairspray so the blowout can survive dancing, humidity, and time.\n\nThis is the kind of look you can request if you want to feel like you\u2019re walking a red carpet instead of just attending a wedding, while still keeping everything soft, romantic, and appropriate.",
