        "image": "assets/doc_b_79_8.jpg",
        "description": "The butterfly cut, popularized by celebrities who love layered, cascading volume, creates one of the most dynamic blowouts you can wear. This cut uses shorter layers around the crown and face with longer lengths underneath, so when you blow it out, the shape almost fans like butterfly wings around your shoulders.\n\nThe blowout emphasizes lift at the crown, bouncy mid-lengths, and ends that flip softly out or under depending on how you brush them. Stylists rely on volumizing mousse, root spray, and a round brush, sometimes finishing with Velcro rollers at the top of the head to lock in height.\n\nOnce brushed out, the look feels full yet lightweight, making it perfect if you want that dramatic celebrity movement in photos without feeling weighed down. It works especially well with center or soft off-center parts.",
