        "image": "assets/doc_b_81_11.jpg",
        "description": "We all have those mornings where we need to get out the door in under five minutes, and this lazy day style is the answer. Simply flip your head upside down, gather all your hair at the top, and begin twisting it as you stand back up.\n\nCoil the twist into a quick bun and snap your favorite claw clip right over the middle to hold it all together. Do not worry about perfection or smooth roots because the charm of this look lies in its effortless and relaxed nature.\n\nIt is the ultimate \u201ccool girl\u201d hairstyle that looks intentional even when you have put in the absolute minimum amount of effort.",
