    "introText": "Looking for an effortless way to sweep your hair up without heat damage or tight elastics? Claw clip buns have quickly become the go-to aesthetic updo for everything from relaxed off-duty mornings to elevated evening looks.\n\nThe secret to a secure, voluminous claw clip style lies in placement and hair texture. Adding a light texturizing spray before twisting gives finer strands grip, while strategic pin tucks keep thicker hair firmly anchored all day long.\n\nBelow, we have rounded up 15+ of the most requested claw clip bun ideas to inspire your everyday styling routine. Save your top picks for quick inspiration!",
