        "description": "Craving a polished, refined look that fights off humidity? The sleek summer claw clip bun keeps flyaways at bay with a smooth, wet-look finish.\n\nYou apply a styling gel or a lightweight pomade from your roots to your ends before gathering the hair at the back. Brush it firmly to eliminate any bumps, then twist it up and secure it tightly with your clip. The sleekness gives off a highly sophisticated and modern vibe that lasts all day. This sharp, clean silhouette works wonderfully for professional settings or upscale summer dinners.\n\nPair it with a crisp white button-down shirt to complete the striking, minimalist aesthetic.",
