        "image": "assets/doc_b_84_19.jpg",
        "description": "Need an updo that keeps shorter layers securely locked in place? The French braid summer claw clip bun starts with a structured braid at the top of your head, catching all those pesky front layers.\n\nYou French braid down to the nape of your neck, then gather the remaining length into a twist and secure it with your clip. The braid acts as an anchor, ensuring no hair falls into your face during a busy summer day. It also creates a beautiful textured contrast against the smooth clip. This secure and stylish option is ideal for amusement park trips or active vacations.\n\nPair it with a casual tank top and comfortable sneakers.",
