        "numberTitle": "18. Side Swept Summer Claw Clip Bun",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_84_10.jpg",
        "description": "Are you in the mood for something slightly asymmetrical and romantic? The side swept summer claw clip bun sweeps all your hair to one side for a dramatically soft effect.\n\nYou gather your hair at the nape, pull it to your preferred side, and twist it upward before securing it behind your ear. This diagonal line creates a beautiful, flattering drape across the back of your head. Leaving a few curly pieces out around your face enhances the soft, romantic vibe. It is a gorgeous choice for outdoor summer weddings or garden parties.\n\nPair this feminine silhouette with a one-shoulder dress to perfectly complement the asymmetrical hairstyle.",
