        "numberTitle": "20. Minimalist Summer Claw Clip Bun",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_84_17.jpg",
        "description": "Sometimes less is truly more, right? The minimalist summer claw clip bun focuses on clean lines and simple, understated elegance.\n\nYou smooth your hair back without excessive teasing or volume, creating a neat, low-slung twist at the nape. A small, matte-finished claw clip in a neutral tone like black, taupe, or ivory holds the style perfectly. This refined look skips the messy tendrils and goes for a streamlined finish that feels incredibly modern. It works beautifully with sleek, straight hair textures and gives off an effortlessly wealthy aesthetic.\n\nPair this simple bun with a high-quality basic tee and gold hoops for a timeless summer afternoon outfit.",
