        "image": "assets/doc_b_85_17.jpg",
        "description": "Deep copper balayage is the choice for women who want warmth and richness without going full fire-engine red. The highlights use a darker, more muted copper tone that feels grounded and sophisticated.\n\nSwept through the mid-lengths and ends, these deep copper ribbons add subtle warmth to dark brunette or black hair. The result is a look that feels expensive and polished, like you just stepped out of a high-end salon. Deep copper also has a beautiful way of catching light without being too flashy. It gives your hair a healthy, glossy appearance that works equally well in professional and casual settings.\n\nThis option is ideal for anyone who wants to dip their toes into the copper trend with a more restrained, refined approach. The color is quiet but undeniably gorgeous.",
