        "numberTitle": "5. Copper Balayage With Money Piece",
        "image": "assets/doc_b_85_14.jpg",
        "description": "The money piece trend shows no signs of slowing down, and pairing it with copper balayage takes the look to new heights. A copper money piece involves painting bright copper highlights on the front sections of your hair that frame your face.\n\nThe rest of your hair gets a softer, more subtle copper balayage treatment. The result is a face-framing pop of color that draws attention to your best features. This technique works on every hair length and texture. It is particularly flattering because it acts like built-in contouring, brightening your complexion and making your eyes pop.\n\nThe front-facing copper pieces also catch the light when you turn your head, creating a gorgeous movement effect. If you want copper color but prefer a more targeted, impactful placement, this is the way to go.",
