        "image": "assets/doc_b_85_6.jpg",
        "description": "Strawberry blonde has always been a crowd favorite, and adding copper balayage takes it to an entirely new level. This look blends soft pinkish-blonde tones with warm copper ribbons for a result that feels romantic and effortless.\n\nThe copper pieces add richness and warmth that plain strawberry blonde sometimes lacks. You get a multi-layered color that shifts between golden, rosy, and fiery depending on the light. This shade is particularly flattering for fair skin tones with pink or neutral undertones. It brightens your complexion and adds a natural-looking glow.\n\nThe hand-painted application means no two heads of hair will ever look exactly the same. Your balayage will be uniquely yours, with the copper pieces placed exactly where they complement your face shape and features best.",
