        "image": "assets/doc_b_85_12.jpg",
        "description": "Caramel and copper together create one of the most wearable and universally flattering color combinations in the book. The caramel pieces add a buttery sweetness, while the copper ribbons bring fiery warmth.\n\nApplied as a balayage on brown hair, this duo creates a look that is rich, dimensional, and incredibly natural. The caramel tones help bridge the gap between the dark brown base and the brighter copper ends, creating a seamless gradient effect. This is an excellent option for first-timers who want to try copper but are not ready for full commitment. The softer caramel transition makes the copper feel approachable rather than intimidating.\n\nIt also looks amazing on all hair lengths, from chin-grazing bobs to waist-length waves. You get warmth, shine, and dimension in one beautiful package.",
