        "image": "assets/doc_b_85_11.jpg",
        "description": "Rose gold everything has been trending for years, and hair color is no exception. Rose gold copper balayage combines the warmth of copper with delicate pink undertones for a result that feels feminine and dreamy.\n\nThe copper base provides richness, while the rose gold accents add a soft, metallic sheen that looks almost ethereal in natural light. This shade works beautifully on light to medium brown hair. It is subtle enough for conservative workplaces but unique enough to turn heads everywhere else. The rose gold tones also complement a wide variety of skin tones, especially those with cool or neutral undertones.\n\nAs the color fades, it transitions gracefully into a softer version of itself. You never get that flat, washed-out look that some fashion colors produce after a few weeks.",
