        "image": "assets/doc_b_85_1.jpg",
        "description": "Going from dark brown to a vivid copper can feel like a big leap. That is exactly why balayage is the perfect technique for this transformation.\n\nInstead of an all-over color change, your stylist hand-paints bright copper ribbons through the mid-lengths and ends. This leaves your natural dark roots intact, giving you a gorgeous grown-out look from day one. The contrast between deep espresso brown and fiery copper creates incredible dimension. It catches light beautifully and makes your hair look thicker and healthier. This option works especially well for women with warm or olive skin tones. The darker base keeps the overall look grounded, while those copper flashes bring all the drama.\n\nYou get the best of both worlds without committing to full coverage color.",
