    "thumbnail": "assets/doc_b_86_2.jpg",
    "introText": "Ready to embrace warm, light-reflecting depth? Auburn hues blend fiery copper ribbons with deep cinnamon and chestnut tones to create a rich, radiant finish full of multidimensional shine.\n\nWhether you prefer subtle warm lowlights or full-coverage mahogany warmth, auburn tones brighten the complexion and instantly elevate natural brown hair.\n\nBelow, browse 15+ stunning auburn hair color ideas tailored for every skin tone and hair length.",
