    "introText": "Looking to add dramatic flair to dark locks? Crimson accents, ruby ribbons, and fiery red highlights create breathtaking contrast on rich black and dark brunette bases.\n\nIncorporating red money pieces or soft balayage ribbons adds instant edge without requiring full-head bleaching, making it a high-style yet hair-healthy option.\n\nBelow, explore 16+ eye-catching red hair color ideas designed to make a bold statement.",
